c:["$","h2",null,{"id":"api-basics","className":"mb-4 mt-14 scroll-mt-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"API basics"}]
d:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":["The API is exposed as an HTTP/1 and HTTP/2 service over SSL. All endpoints live under the URL ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"https://api.shadw.cloud"}]," and follow the REST architecture."]}]
e:["$","h2",null,{"id":"authentication","className":"mb-4 mt-14 scroll-mt-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"Authentication"}]
f:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":["Authenticate with a platform ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"API key"}]," — a long-lived, team-bound token prefixed ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"hive_"}],". Create one under"," ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Settings → API Keys"}]," (or with"," ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"POST /v1/apikeys"}],"). The full token is shown exactly once at creation; only its SHA-256 hash is stored. Include it in the ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"Authorization"}]," header:"]}]
10:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":["$","$L25",null,{"tabs":[{"label":"Authorization","lang":"bash","code":"Authorization: Bearer hive_…"}]}]}]
11:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":["Alternatively, mint a short-lived (8 hour) JWT with ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"POST /v1/token"}]," and present it in the same header. Minting requires ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"HIVE_JWT_SECRET"}]," to be configured on the node; when JWT auth is enforced, mutating requests (POST/PUT/DELETE) must present a JWT."]}]
12:["$","h2",null,{"id":"accessing-team-resources","className":"mb-4 mt-14 scroll-mt-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"Accessing team resources"}]
13:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":["Every request resolves to a team (tenant), in this priority order: a JWT's"," ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"tenant"}]," claim wins; otherwise an API key scopes the request to the team it was created under — no extra header needed; otherwise, on nodes without JWT enforcement (no"," ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"HIVE_JWT_SECRET"}],", e.g. local dev), the ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"x-hive-team"}]," header is honored. With none of these, requests fall back to the ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"personal"}]," team."]}]
14:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":["$","$L25",null,{"tabs":[{"label":"cURL","lang":"bash","code":"# An API key is already bound to its team — no team header needed.\ncurl https://api.shadw.cloud/v1/overview \\\n  -H 'Authorization: Bearer hive_…'"}]}]}]
