16:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":["API requests are rate-limited per team. When you exceed the limit the API responds with"," ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]","children":"429 Too Many Requests"}],"; back off and retry after the window resets. Burst limits are higher on Pro and Enterprise plans."]}]
